          "quote": "是否需要做手术"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "HO1 was triggered and the doctor partially reconstructed the transition state using family documents and follow-up planning. It is not complete because the trajectory did not fully demonstrate active reconciliation of patient-requested discharge, CT recommendation, and procedure status beyond minimum handoff duties.",
