          "explanation": "The doctor asked the caregiver to obtain and transmit discharge and imaging information rather than assuming facts.",
          "quote": "出院小结、关键的超声或CT报告"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00131",
          "explanation": "The doctor integrated the discharge diagnoses provided by the caregiver.",
          "quote": "胆囊结石伴胆囊炎、2型糖尿病、乙肝小三阳"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 was met: the doctor sought discharge documents, medication details, and follow-up information, used available record access attempts, and did not assume a completed gallbladder operation without support.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
