          "quote": "请立即前往急诊"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00394",
          "explanation": "The doctor organized external surgical checks and endocrine follow-up as parallel next steps.",
          "quote": "先执行外科检查，同时预约内分泌"
        }
      ],
