          "quote": "您总结得非常全面、准确"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 was met: the caregiver repeatedly restated the plan, and the doctor confirmed the checklist, added a low-glucose escalation boundary, and maintained clear emergency thresholds and unresolved follow-up items.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
